title: "NCSKit: A Serverless, WebAssembly-Powered Statistical Analysis Platform with Automated APA Interpretation"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-13
url: "https://ncskit.org"
repository-code: "https://github.com/hailp1/ncskit"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  NCSKit is an open-source, serverless web application that executes a complete
  R statistical environment (via WebR/WebAssembly) entirely within the browser.
  It introduces the Automated Statistical Insight Generation (ASIG) engine — a
  deterministic rule-based system that translates raw statistical outputs into
  APA 7th Edition narrative interpretations across 22 analysis types, removing
  the need for server-side infrastructure and ensuring 100% client-side data
  privacy.
